{"id": "t096-003", "text": "Remind me to ask Carmen how her driving test went on Tuesday morning. She was really nervous about the roundabouts.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Carmen how her driving test went", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about the roundabouts", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t096-005", "text": "Jonah supports Everton and has had a season ticket since he was nine. He goes with his dad to every home game.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jonah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Everton", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has had a season ticket", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since he was nine"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t096-007", "text": "Kate mentioned she's started knitting again after about five years off. She's making a blanket for her niece, chunky cream wool with a cable pattern, and wants to try Fair Isle colourwork next. She swears by the yarn from that little shop on Albert Road and hates the acrylic stuff from the big craft chains. A nice skein from there would go down really well for her birthday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "knitting", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after about five years off"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "niece", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f9", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to try Fair Isle colourwork", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "yarn from that little shop on Albert Road", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates the acrylic stuff from the big craft chains", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nice skein from there would go down really well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}]}
{"id": "t096-010", "text": "Lola works at the council in planning, has done for about six years. Her partner Rana is a paramedic.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lola", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works at the council in planning", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "about six years"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rana", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "paramedic", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t096-012", "text": "Salma's mum has her hip operation on 9/22. Salma is going to stay with her for a week afterwards.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip operation", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/22", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stay with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t096-015", "text": "I'm taking Petra to the airport tomorrow morning at 6. Her flight to Toronto is at 9:40.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning at 6", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight to Toronto", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "9:40", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t096-021", "text": "Mehmet's favourite thing is proper Turkish tea, strong, in the little tulip glasses, with two sugar cubes. He thinks English breakfast tea is basically dishwater. He also loves pistachio baklava but only from the bakery in Green Lanes, and he doesn't eat pork. His wife Magda is the opposite and drinks about six cans of Diet Coke a day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "proper Turkish tea", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinks English breakfast tea is basically dishwater", "fact_type": "dislike", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pistachio baklava but only from the bakery in Green Lanes", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't eat pork", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "drinks about six cans of Diet Coke a day", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t096-022", "text": "Emily works as a nurse at St James's, on the children's ward, mostly nights. She lives in Headingley with two flatmates and her boyfriend lives in Harrogate. Her parents are in Cornwall and her older sister Fiona is a teacher in Exeter with three kids of her own. She says she's the only one in the family who left the south west.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works as a nurse at St James's, on the children's ward, mostly nights", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Headingley", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "flatmates", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Harrogate", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Cornwall", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "r3"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "older sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "teacher", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "only one in the family who left the south west", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t096-023", "text": "Adaeze is doing Dry January again, and she's going pescatarian from the start of the year as well. Coffee is the one thing she won't give up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Dry January", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pescatarian", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from the start of the year"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Coffee", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t096-025", "text": "Graham collects old railway posters and has about forty framed in his hallway. He'd love one of the Scarborough ones if I ever see one at a fair.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "old railway posters", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has about forty framed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "love one of the Scarborough ones", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t096-031", "text": "Shira plays the cello in a community orchestra. They have a concert on November 8th at 7:30 at St Mary's, and she's playing a short solo. She said she hasn't slept properly in a week thinking about it. I'd like to go if I'm free, and I should text her good luck that afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cello", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "community orchestra", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "concert", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 8th at 7:30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d9", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t096-032", "text": "Finally sorted my own plans for half term. I'm driving up to my aunt's on the 24th and coming back the following Sunday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "half term", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 24th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the following Sunday evening", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t096-033", "text": "Damian's wife Petra is pregnant again, due around April 2nd. Their eldest, Leo, is apparently thrilled about being a big brother.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Damian", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "around April 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leo", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled about being a big brother", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p3"}]}
{"id": "t096-039", "text": "Called Fiona tonight. Her dad has been in hospital since last Wednesday with pneumonia, and she's exhausted from driving back and forth. They're hoping he'll be discharged by Friday morning. I need to ring her again on Sunday, and maybe drop off some food at hers this weekend so she doesn't have to cook.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since last Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pneumonia", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted from driving back and forth", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "discharged", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her again", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some food at hers", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t096-041", "text": "Ana said she's started climbing at the bouldering wall near her office. She goes three times a week and is already on the blue routes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "climbing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "goes three times a week", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "on the blue routes", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t096-043", "text": "Hiroshi is a huge fan of Studio Ghibli and has a shelf of Totoro figures. He also plays the shamisen, which I didn't know.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hiroshi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Studio Ghibli", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has a shelf of Totoro figures", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "shamisen", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t096-044", "text": "Gym, then groceries. Need eggs, spinach, and something for Thursday's dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "groceries", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "eggs, spinach, and something for Thursday's dinner", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t096-049", "text": "Michael and his partner Graham are moving to Brighton on June 30th, which I didn't expect at all. The removal van comes at 8am that morning. Michael has already found a job at a design studio there, starting Monday July 7, and Graham will keep working remotely. Remind me to text Michael on the 7th to see how the first day went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Brighton", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 30th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "8am that morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at a design studio", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starting", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday July 7", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "working remotely", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Michael", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 7th", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t096-052", "text": "Joseph is training for the Berlin marathon on September 27th. He's doing long runs every Sunday morning and says his left knee is starting to complain. Don't forget to ask how the eighteen-miler went this weekend, and send him a good luck message on the 26th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joseph", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Berlin marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 27th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Sunday morning"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "left knee is starting to complain", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how the eighteen-miler went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "eighteen-miler", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a good luck message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 26th", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t096-054", "text": "Kate's brother Jonah is getting married on August 9th in Galway. She's a bridesmaid and has the hen do on July 19.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jonah", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "bridesmaid", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 19", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t096-056", "text": "Ava is learning Portuguese on Duolingo because her partner's family is from Porto. She has a 200-day streak and is weirdly competitive about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Portuguese", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Porto", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "200-day streak", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "weirdly competitive about it", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t096-058", "text": "Shira's grandad turns ninety on March 3rd. The family is hiring a hall for a lunch at 1pm, and she's in charge of the cake. She's asked if I can help her bake it the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns ninety", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "1pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t096-060", "text": "Graham's son Owen has had a rough week at uni, homesick and behind on deadlines. Graham's driving down to see him tomorrow afternoon. I must remember to ask Graham on Friday how Owen's getting on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "at uni", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "homesick", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving down to see him", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Graham on Friday how Owen's getting on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}]}
